<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage 7.60 bln rand Monday.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage 7.60 bln rand Monday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 7.599 billion rand on Monday from 6.700 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
